group features/gui
note Click a group's row in the Tours list to open or close it. The reader reaches for it to close the groups they are not working in, which would otherwise list every tour in the map at once. A closed group hides every tour and group inside it; the row shows the group's last name segment, the number of tours under it, and turns red when any of them has a stale step. Until clicked, a group is open exactly when the tour being read is inside it. The choice lasts for the session.

